{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1531,
  "batch_count": 1662,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "c0513553da490a692523f45b5f779f99f6cb7e34",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7090f7ec866e5a08903f3a48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87456eb82e2aa4b3467f9a35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一开始还以为是个正经人呢。\r\n结果突然就疯狂装傻…\r\n真是的，受不了你…呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d60ffa38202aae4e16569572efab0f8d31c99a36fb61ac36fac03b60316c8fe6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c933d7b476bbaaacb3cc714",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我走了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01ba9d22bb7ed5021c941456f51a0bbc52c890fa31ed6683933d3d474294f1e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d95c6656978a3fda2e622317",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3f071de3a132d55ed31edf557b362afda8ef29b618fd0f52a13920ed7d26bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89f99ea592ed386a2d23d5d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…不用太勉强。只要顺其自然地\r\n装傻，凭我的吐槽\r\n也会让你变得很有趣的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0127534a4e2e334c9e48416bcacd0c5a0b735799f71c651f40928f2c56484c70",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a850578aab9d9b603e9ba09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那套西装有在保养吗？\r\n服装也要好好管理才行哦。\r\n…我还想再一起说相声呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "de8fdcc9275816d17ee2bd1ef3f3e84f7bee54c235798e911174b04815ab2b55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a869fb5b5248f484d7f5b19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正月的电视节目真的很有趣…\r\n哎，看什么？那当然是——\r\n音乐节目之类的，有很多吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2787489ba744108a34646e11ce89786bf37b9ad976189bc21c3b1926326f96da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50e4e193c5da5e21daa756cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "（黄金巨匠同学，收到了数量惊人的\r\n巧克力啊…！那个量…\r\n都能开店了吧…！？）",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f4a5feec8410ac94ae5f2440160345b5253d8bd4f92144ad7d6bf20c18d4b15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:752da2ec954a19bdd3ca5fd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我试着做了点可露丽。\r\n如果不介意的话，可以告诉我感——…啊，\r\n这个时候就不用装傻了哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "745e3624d01d02d7e396818ce5d6281bff6520930233fede311a92367dc45821",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69e2ed98b9fe281c86c41a1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然写了短册…嘛，光是祈愿\r\n是不够的呢。要是那颗耀眼的\r\n星星能马上来到我身边就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c99664b56353bd6f00c5fc38ea1f124944b8ed7325c342a5664dbc68084e08b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35b65455fa5626e91d31ad37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "（穿着全身绿色的紧身衣伪装成草地…！\r\n那到底是什么啊，也太前卫了吧…\r\n难道就没有别的伪装了吗…！？）",
      "source_fingerprint": "48b6f1ca170cafa13bce289955fa0429f2329b8f45cca1ff6070a30badda0be4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84f02dd678965909ca77605c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "（新口红和耳环都买了，\r\n准备应该已经万全了…！走吧——\r\n黄金旅程前辈她们的派对…！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d2022fa6a6e760129694100b12d27e61fdf3c247b7dc2f829af5266a41fd5c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7a5b766ff196dc90752ba84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员室，又装饰得\r\n非常漂亮呢。…真是的，\r\n你还真是个乐天派啊。呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66419996bf6f773ecd9f8a329691b33025d697e44a2d331687c22b32224c223a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e4464f5989673cbe0208924",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和我想的一样呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f26083a570d8e27ce90c1d7bc10954d50d322d3506558bb8d2b9f7871df3a11",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a1fd7ff1db816c60bf4dcd4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "年末年初好歹要回老家露个脸。\r\n买点关东的特产带回去吧…呵呵，\r\n我已经能看到妹妹们欢闹的样子了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c90f0e107251841bc12169f5186079f0599649db2609c439e69cb633b33db91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:567b70685fbec655202366e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝你生日快乐。\r\n…至少在今天，随你怎么装傻\r\n都可以。我会奉陪到底的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3231ad2729af2e6ce4221f12afc3276f448b8338acd7355ef7295ad3e0ac2dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4298c0332581efa91a127139",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚才给你的香薰炉，请务必\r\n试着用一下。希望今天这个日子\r\n你能过得丰富多彩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4530661ad5ae0e0f1cfaf83caf85240836ca20a62fbbe8d5e0b0c3cd42d72ac1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e686119cf003d9c08ff27ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "（黄金船同学她们穿着西装\r\n看着我！怎、怎么回事…舞会\r\n的邀请吗？怎么可能啦…）",
      "source_fingerprint": "e388dcc1f0b99e6adcbb0ee7044da601d725c88b7bbfc7a287e15c41f8e4ef4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44d5a42bcd96781de67efe1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀～！满心期待地打开你送的\r\n礼物，结果里面竟然是把大纸扇！\r\n我都分不清你是认真的还是在装傻了…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e336313bd16e321b3ec16006b61312632651da9462781f00850444e47149aadc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bf78b4282e4fdbaa7075a26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有通知。\r\n趁还没忘记，赶紧看看吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "27a75192868ed0c0a6643e1c784073868904e866099041b38beaba4019f7f479",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbf60c1d8e002dcbcb18bfbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说是礼物。会是谁送的呢。\r\n得好好道谢才行啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbb7a8a62d536c1eeab07486eddc1515490b70e1b975e13b260f4931e48181ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68fe0f78b798aad37875c79e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成了呢。\r\n…明明原本是个\r\n很认真的人啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d0d515cbab6b8d8056fa99c1f452bb325a7684ca22187d78cef078ba4976dbf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebc3d3bc54b1c6f222bdc0a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动好像要开始了。\r\n那么准备——等等，你拿那么多\r\n东西干嘛…打算玩借物装傻吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b966652d86e82238db53aa6219874e27f37e5753e7033f9b162efd2ef14c0b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eebc7a5cfb5f4a0d546a56ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动已经开始了呢。\r\n——…可没有时间再装傻了。\r\n快走吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eac4b32fcde294dc54d63e21559af38d6df25530fa4289ae390436c566cf225c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b510ba45dfb183778b98064",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…下一个呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "740c77b0c6de00aaab1c35abaf23cf700a4e6c4516566b6a82aa6a8e0cd78b28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e052e29b8e1d2817e3f21f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说名鉴升级了。\r\n干得漂亮啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d77df91585c4d1d49bf21d42f4255e1aad8d9615f244de3447d8387d60a2469",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fe8553609a73e442665ce51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一直很注意保持体型。\r\n为了能把这种裤装风格\r\n也穿得修长挺拔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0f69d9eb14c01be69c333075b29f36efe0c8a4eaa6e884be93273d205fd4f25",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10e997a356135b2b7756985e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "（这件衣服不错吧？既高雅\r\n又华丽，而且——竟然还是，\r\n跳楼价三折！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4c21fac71e6f69efff84dbccc9e0aea31de49022a28231a366963282680772b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e8200d73126e66c3d93c1bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "黄金巨匠同学的私服，\r\n真的很漂亮啊。别人根本\r\n穿不出那种感觉。…不愧是她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bdb0e9d2f5bc3e891631d013f810fd284d9ed48422b4eaac02b3253be4124b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:395375e10367cca83566983e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还算可以吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6d9117caac5f10035a8b726fafbdae4c37176fb68f3b1c04f4db63e237a4120",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40aa03b7d23d45d0dfa1126f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多亏了大家。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b36a1c327e86271262361cb1033dfe57d714157ec5d8d673d99fe2b26d5623eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0de46b4de493eb8b51e672fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…下一个呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "740c77b0c6de00aaab1c35abaf23cf700a4e6c4516566b6a82aa6a8e0cd78b28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2a189ed805257ce2c6ead35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还算可以吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6d9117caac5f10035a8b726fafbdae4c37176fb68f3b1c04f4db63e237a4120",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e302977ac93a80cd6517b5ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刷新纪录了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbd54b5d65ed7ad95de265a239cd7e0357feca6ed137778f4af2090df7519eb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6449fa1d82d65fd9aa296737",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么我们走吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "776a4ff7cc24f0b0a8dd0d57905bb0558eedbb89704b99852e649948b7ed4b86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c96c98ce534393df23b56ac8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21b02e6c9308dab9387f7c49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在是忍耐，并锻炼的时候呢。\r\n那么训练，\r\n开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54fe83ffe7131a1ea46cee27fdc243317d8c4cdd2470ab241cdf20c2f0ee4468",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b375f81a8cb577de5ed1c3b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "各位活跃的身姿，\r\n真是华丽啊…\r\n我也得打起精神努力才行了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e19a14dba96fba62cf966e22b2cc35bfaec1eb567d1ed793f20b2ad9ad71257",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d533bab40009eb6999db06d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是赛事呢。\r\n——忍耐并锻炼至今的成果，\r\n现在就让大家见识一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70357ad64a742efc016192e7ada2e0a0c254272413b96ded5ae9d75f8f682f70",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:170d69b548e231c831ffeb96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68d1ccbe412517d037eba3349a53caf52ee4216f3314987c5d59645520f8f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a287103ed62fbe59fd3c4d8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀呀，真是太耀眼了…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb38a6c89703ee63b63769f14fc2796184046db8ec65607b07a6d5ddee005b88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdb88635e8fdea77754168ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "差不多该拿出真本事了——",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d6a84ebed1c088f4ba390d962010f761b55e449dcdd9ea647cd9e3e56ebbf78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "1262"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5627b4d385d5c102f3e204cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "凛然高雅地——",
      "source_fingerprint": "0387568784a3c77f024f62d7e51bc2a7309e46294c0ac5c753277b57184fadb9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "1263"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21353229d2e755eac18296dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给，今天的登录奖励。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fdf8ba2cd2254a9dbfab45e3b30e0288ae83fe2cff894df6ce087eb5001bd36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ff849fae410c9a9bbcf8e2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "瞄准好再上吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91e494d7b5257e37780d0822df1a86db17442fb4b6197b619540cf2d325ebbd7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75781e50741381faf599e344",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "挺不错的嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "161d8cbbc4c3c42b6cf619aa820f8935051550f27e2b0f9b3b7a34678ed2f9f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb37c53c74ef8f5db1c6f935",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀哎呀…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db3092a508ac1c62b92775252c21d2a01a79a258ce9b7de7f81a6678b06dae19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8e319f3fbeb2d4effc5e102",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来了好多人啊♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ac89698cdacc1d20e346f4f17f28edf4e83e59d092c5def7e7644418a9786ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "140003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f57c34db216beaa4d675bbf6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，干得漂亮。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da1b401cc87f73977fe2955572a50018ad6241ebdadef94c44e22c017d67cfef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "140004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:933a29899a4a64fd1b2cf7d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…嘛，别灰心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e07cbf4d60bcadcc4e208c9d4bd8c8854dab272f2b32ae48018d5d74aedad53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "140005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7e305a5acf0d5394f3c2504",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来了好多人啊♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ac89698cdacc1d20e346f4f17f28edf4e83e59d092c5def7e7644418a9786ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "140006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06ecad4ab7de84f3fac91ea2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，干得漂亮。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da1b401cc87f73977fe2955572a50018ad6241ebdadef94c44e22c017d67cfef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "140007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0356f47f5419e217017d18ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8af85ce981d9ec89ad4d75b1bd062ebe03e9f22dc5edb7cd9b8099f05574c6c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "140008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94b73879eca17930d60c3b27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb75f8d097324489df9101b9fb1301ac4112567bf0af3df0f690cd98a27eee1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "140009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb0ea77086b593c2fd8de917",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…搞什么鬼啊！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "22d2d95dc909d8164fa7768f302a65dba0aa3d821c519965f1fd83535fe40df2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "140010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6daba492418ca063ef674071",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是机会呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bac98a518392631d1bab807e1833afb31952fa923db78b75759daf607433623",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "140011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be283e8d38c04df2fb33ef25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好厉害…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4171fea5297955ee74bf063ebbf4e44837a2de20e3c743747e9fd71a53675a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "140012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8921f8a44c6994d1cd5f8682",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就这样保持…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96922a4963ab7c55ff48ea476c2888799d2bfd2c677d3e678ed2239db64f6d5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c38cb441b07c43f644f8ca1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真可惜…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d565f7d24c02d5ad867ca75b48238623a036e7dec0758f74ab52924324feffa6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:984680de2754ea8be6cb5cce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯—…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cd721714121b892191250e0f21c8950fe949f3eecb21153c0eea3eaaac43090",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f422194d397408e37685d05a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还没到睡觉时间哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "493412ae0994e07a54406ed2711d13c7dca57c91a06816ec0a59b405baaf440a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d321a10d19a75ea513ca6683",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "骗人的吧…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3c28d9cd9cc7ad4defb253cc97822aa9099b8008e208fdb627d999c4f8bd4b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ace8172e4da0db393068fa7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不行吗…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "743c6026ccfafc510e4793bcc87db79a59fdaee30746b0ed9b01bac8cb08062c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:930164baa8a8eaebbc771a0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天好像能拿到这个哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc13d7879f148f8bc9f9908f93ef5621f6ef3e50c6581f1f80ed98dd749775bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3ad7a080eb91f054097713b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…我还没问题。\r\n能忍耐到什么程度才是关键。\r\n好了，开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdaf1ec9b9adbdc1eb97af791f95e00960399025f83aa3c22cffc0b33055e9c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68dd63161caa4b2f3247aeab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "（荣获年度最辛苦大奖，\r\n太不容易了部门的三星评价哦～…）",
      "source_fingerprint": "e46edb2199a120695168d385a15636416d3631c88eb7bfa1cae6fc66463c8179",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:033798483fd6b8b27ec8b132",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "花坛里开着美丽的花。\r\n即使刮风也顽强地挺立着——\r\n…呵呵，总觉得从它们身上获得了力量呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa2d1b669ba1a102923fdef0aebccccbf80fb7c14b98fef4588ed4fb7b8d5a8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30ea9191c71fa6d31ffb2b1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "（今天的运势，是大吉耶！\r\n那么训练什么的完全小菜一碟\r\n嘛♪多少我都能做哦～！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "b851edfea0d783c04d2ae0764b0c4de5564b763438920693852712b3c7c504b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:853561e81bfcb3d7ebacfaa1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目标已经很明确了。\r\n剩下的就只有实践。\r\n那么，我们要从什么开始呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d13cd14ed01bb49ee7e1c855eeb73461aae9dee34dfe43981b6c0c86c3a4db8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf218a27cb4a22f2dfcdb5b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "（薰衣草盛开的阳台～…\r\n——等等，啊哈哈！不行，\r\n太无聊了反而戳中笑点了！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "087268761691d791344fcbdd16b93173f75818250757b6485ee327fe2b528811",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9674a29dfaf060e619b33a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了让美丽的大花绽放——\r\n来吧，今天也精进自我吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "396c4e48e4eb905ff613f2b8e9054ddb08c87b17403ab86f674a3ff73b2c3d65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:569f59b454f12432b7851863",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "（哎…宿舍房间的灯，我关了\r\n没有来着…？我应该是最后\r\n一个出来的吧…我没关吗！？）",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9d20a9f01c19b53bce76f027cf6e85789751befbb2aa45f149473724c7c85ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c374f04a43d4a4401f945fbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…像往常一样进行吧。\r\n正是因为一直仰望着太阳，\r\n花儿才会绽放的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03a4ce3532ef80529796373421dc9384997a0a49adc2c626a69b507fa83d9c6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0054f69bb50a4988294338ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "（什么啊，那边墙上的黑色污渍…\r\n是脏东西，还是什么东西的影子…到底是哪个啊？\r\n嗯～～～～？到底是哪个！？）",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e4dea4de03540cdff7a9d516bca2285d992d9d3bb70ec873544e4722983cd25",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94968bf091985bbe6a8126c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那边的路，是谁弄脏的啊…\r\n啊真是的…对不起，\r\n我可以去清理一下吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebb763825dd652ef187619d9875dad9fa6082782701398024599f572db4df2a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:824c7031291b39280c9a6712",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "（哈啊…今天的广播节目里\r\n也没有读我的邮件…\r\n工匠之路真是险峻啊～～…）",
      "source_fingerprint": "08e83f8f7e95bf05a9f3a7e0d4d165c8e55c57b6328b0bb70a8500aa53d354c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a73064769d51aa54641cba4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…你认真的吗？不，\r\n这不管怎么说也太地狱了吧…\r\n这可是违反合规条例要出局的哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06d4e4f1dce5ab6e1a264f080874cdba7a946e9dee6bf73760b1ddcd98736fac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:821512bf612f7cc82a09b117",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…那个啊，我才不想让人看到\r\n我萎靡不振、丢人现眼的样子呢。\r\n这点程度，你应该明白吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fd6a8069820389455f7f717ca0c3e815dbcbf8a0336219fb36bcdfa6e08541c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd04f4f33c294170873e360a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在正是作为『明星』，\r\n尽情绽放的时刻——千娇百媚的光辉，\r\n就让你们见识一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "725c7ca145e754f9627210846e3e30ae520c0f2a2681d95d2301cbace1cbe1e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c67a9ddbf30b7b939e19a1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "紫丁香是忍耐严冬才会绽放的花。\r\n…我也是一样的。经历了多少忍耐\r\n就会绽放得多么鲜艳夺目。",
      "source_fingerprint": "059c713993347ce3ebb861afd89f713f4c48dce3a2a35a16f07bf09afcce6b28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "20024"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
